// checkbox-interactions's demos (reference: content/articles/checkbox-interactions/components/checkbox/): twenty
// cuisine chips under "What are your favourite cuisines?", Italian picked; a tap toggles one. Demo animates it as
// the reference's framer-motion does: the chip's fill and border and the label's colour on a spring (stiffness 500,
// damping 30), the check icon coming in (opacity 150 ms, scale 0.5 → 1 on a spring 500/25, baked from the spring's
// motion) and going out the same way back, the chip's growth and the other chips' moves a layout spring 500/30.
// StaticDemo changes at once.
//
// The check is the reference's glyph (U+F429 of its one-glyph AntDesign font, antdesign-check-circle.woff2) as an
// SVG path in the glyph's em box: 18 px, 512 units per em, ascent 455, descent 81, centred in the 16 px slot as the
// reference's line box is.
//
// Exports, as the article's MDX names them:
//   Demo()
//   StaticDemo()
// <baked> (gesture-kit/.tools/bake.ts writes this block)
